[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/Dazed-Workshop/main/Defences/images/banner.jpg?v=2[/img]

Traps, door braces and early warning for your base in [b]Build 42[/b]. Part of the Dazed suite.

[table]
[tr][td][b]Game version[/b][/td][td]Build 42 only (42.0+)[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Requires[/b][/td][td][b]Dazed Core[/b] (subscribe to it too)[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Multiplayer[/b][/td][td]Yes. The server decides every trap[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Add mid-save[/b][/td][td]Yes[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Mod ID[/b][/td][td]DazedDefences[/td][/tr]
[/table]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/Dazed-Workshop/main/Defences/images/h-traps.png?v=2[/img]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/Dazed-Workshop/main/Defences/images/traps.png?v=2[/img]
[list]
[*][b]Tin-can alarm line:[/b] cans on a string. Rattles when a zombie touches it, makes a little noise and tells you where.
[*][b]Spike pit:[/b] dug with a shovel. Zombies fall in, take a few stakes and stay down for a few seconds.
[*][b]Nail board:[/b] nails through planks. Slows and cuts what walks over it, and can puncture a vehicle's tyre.
[*][b]Door brace bar:[/b] right-click a door from inside, Fit brace brackets (hammer, 4 nails, 1 plank, once per door), then drop a plank or metal bar into the brackets. It locks the door and takes the hits until it snaps. Lift the brace bar to get it back.
[*][b]Reinforced Gate:[/b] built from the vanilla build menu (Carpentry, Woodwork 4) with planks and sheet metal. 800 health against a wooden gate's 300, and it takes the brace bar like a door.
[*]Every trap wears out. Right-click it to see how worn it is, repair it or take it down for part of its materials.
[/list]

[h2]Sandbox[/h2]
Whether traps hurt players (off by default), whether nail boards puncture tyres, trap damage, trap durability, how far an alarm line is heard, how strong the door brace is and whether the bar locks the door. With Dazed Signal, a tripped alarm line is read out on the survivor radio.

